  "title": "はじめての アルバイト",
  "summary": "Your first shift at Café Aozora. Say what you can and cannot do, list reasons with し, and read how things look.",
  "covers": "〜られる / 〜える (can do) · が with can-do verbs · 〜し、〜し · 〜そうです (looks like)",
